<title>USA: Chancellor sees Q4, Q1 filing delay.</title>
<headline>Chancellor sees Q4, Q1 filing delay.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chancellor Group Inc said on Monday it expects to file its 10-K report for the year ended July 31, 1996, and the first quarter ended October 31, 1996, within the next four to eight weeks.</p>
<p>The company said the delay in reporting earnings is a result of a complicated structure that involves different accounting treatments used by separate auditors for all of the companies of which Chancellor holds controlling interests.</p>
</text>
